@startuml
[*] --> ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser : identify user from request
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos : gather videos based on user profile or preferences, trending videos, similar tags, genres, and promoted videos
GatherVideos --> AddDetails : add thumbnails and view counts to suggested videos
AddDetails --> SendVideos : send suggested videos to user
SendVideos --> [*]
@enduml
